Subject: 0001-cuda-conv3d-direct-pascal
CUDA conv3d: implicit-GEMM SIMT kernel for Pascal (no tensor cores); bit-identical to the stock kernel. Env GGML_CUDA_CONV3D_OLD selects the stock kernel.

